---
layout: layout.njk
title: Extend
points:
  - icon: fa-globe
    title: Just a website
    description: "An extension is plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript hosted at a public URL. Use any static host: GitHub Pages, Netlify, Vercel, S3, your own server."
  - icon: fa-window-maximize
    title: Loaded in an IFRAME
    description: Manager embeds your extension URL in an &lt;iframe&gt;. Your code runs inside that iframe, isolated from the rest of Manager.
  - icon: fa-arrow-right-arrow-left
    title: postMessage to talk to Manager
    description: Your extension calls window.parent.postMessage(...) to send a request. Manager receives it, handles it, and posts a message back into the iframe.
  - icon: fa-tag
    title: Request / response by type
    description: Every request has a type (for example get-account). Manager replies with the same type plus -response (for example get-account-response).
---
{% set code = "px-1 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-100 text-slate-800 text-sm" %}
{% set codeOnGrey = "px-1 py-0.5 rounded bg-white ring-1 ring-gray-200 text-slate-800 text-sm" %}
{% set pre = "mt-6 bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 rounded-lg p-4 overflow-x-auto text-sm" %}

<!-- Hero -->
